    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Karachi, Pakistan  - The Aga Khan University's Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) will host its annual conference, themed \"Building Thriving Communities: Promoting Brain and Mental Health,\" from November 3-5, 2025, at the Aga Khan University (AKU) campus in Karachi, Pakistan. The hybrid event will bring together researchers, policymakers, health professionals, educators and community leaders from across Asia, Africa and beyond to explore innovations and collaborations that advance mental health and brain science for community well-being.",
